- Pak!

252
00:15:04.988 --> 00:15:07.072
- Tolong, tuan!
- Lepaskan aku!

253
00:15:07.073 --> 00:15:08.824
- Ra In-ho!
- Dasar bajingan.

254
00:15:08.825 --> 00:15:10.951
Jalurnya aman. Ya, tuan.

255
00:15:10.952 --> 00:15:12.329
Kami punya situasi, Pak.

256
00:15:12.954 --> 00:15:15.332
Kami berada di bawah darurat militer, Pak!

257
00:15:16.124 --> 00:15:17.292
Kami butuh bantuan, Pak.

258
00:15:19.544 --> 00:15:21.463
Warga sipil telah memasuki kompleks tersebut.

259
00:15:23.506 --> 00:15:25.342
Apa yang harus kami lakukan, Pak?

260
00:15:27.510 --> 00:15:29.179
Apa-apaan ini?

261
